        "Content": "A rare opportunity to acquire full private ownership of this beautifully presented two-bedroom lodge-style residence, ideally positioned within the prestigious grounds of Fota Island Resort. This offers a superb investment opportunity with excellent rental opportunities both short & long term. \r\n\r\nNo. 30 Courtyard Lodges is presented in excellent condition throughout and set within an idyllic, mature, and beautifully landscaped estate environment. The property combines the charm and tranquillity of an old-world estate with the exceptional leisure amenities associated with one of Ireland's most renowned resort destinations.\r\n\r\nThe property is approached via attractive landscaped grounds with a cobblelock pathway and resident parking. It also benefits from a security barrier at entrance. Internally, the accommodation is bright, spacious, and beautifully maintained, with quality finishes throughout, including oak doors, tiled flooring, recessed lighting, high-quality kitchen worktops, and luxurious fully tiled bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features a welcoming entrance hall, guest W.C., and an impressive open-plan living and dining area with an inset electric fireplace. Doors lead directly from the living space onto a private rear patio and beautifully maintained rear gardens, creating a wonderful setting for relaxing or entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe fully fitted kitchen is both practical and stylish, incorporating a range of integrated appliances, high-quality worktops, tiled flooring, and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, both benefiting from beautifully appointed en-suite facilities. The principal bedroom overlooks the front and features built-in wardrobes, while the second bedroom overlooks the rear and benefits from attractive oak wardrobes. Both en-suites are fully tiled and include chrome heated towel rails, with the rear bedroom enjoying a modern power shower.\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a luxurious weekend retreat, a second home, a peaceful escape, or an investment property, No. 30 Courtyard Lodges offers a truly special opportunity to enjoy resort living within an exceptional setting.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nA welcoming entrance hall with attractive tiled flooring, recessed lighting, and quality oak doors. The hallway provides access to the principal living accommodation and guest W.C.\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nFully tiled, comprising a W.C. and wash-hand basin. Heated towel rail and recessed lighting.\r\nOpen-Plan Living Area\r\nA bright and generous open-plan living and dining space, beautifully presented with quality finishes throughout.\r\nThe living room features an attractive inset electric fireplace, recessed lighting, and a door leading directly to the private rear patio and landscaped rear gardens. The outdoor area provides an ideal space for relaxing and enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\r\nKitchen\r\nA stylish and fully fitted kitchen with a comprehensive range of integrated appliances, worktops, and tiled flooring.\r\nThe kitchen is finished with recessed lighting and provides a practical yet elegant space, which opens naturally into the main living accommodation.\r\nLanding\r\nFully carpeted staircase and landing providing access to both bedrooms.\r\nBedroom 1\r\nA spacious double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring built-in wardrobes.\r\nEn suite\r\nFully tiled en-suite bathroom incorporating W.C., wash-hand basin, and bath with overhead shower. Heated towel rail and quality sanitary ware.\r\nBedroom 2\r\nA generous double bedroom overlooking the rear gardens, with built-in wardrobes.\r\nEn suite\r\nFully tiled en-suite incorporating a W.C., wash-hand basin, and modern power shower. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nThe property enjoys an attractive approach through beautifully landscaped communal grounds, with a cobblelock pathway leading to the entrance.\r\nTo the rear is a private patio area together with landscaped rear gardens, providing a peaceful and attractive outdoor space and an excellent extension of the living accommodation during the warmer months.\r\nThere is also designated parking to the front of the property.\r\n\r\nFota Island & The Surrounding Area\r\nFota Island is one of Cork's most distinctive and sought-after locations, offering an exceptional blend of natural beauty, heritage, leisure, and accessibility.\r\nSet within a magnificent, mature estate, the island is renowned for its beautiful woodland, landscaped grounds, and peaceful surroundings. At the heart of the area is the prestigious Fota Island Resort, providing an impressive range of luxury amenities, including its renowned championship golf course, hotel, and spa facilities.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly attractive for those seeking a peaceful retreat without sacrificing convenience. Fota Train Station is within easy reach, providing rail connections towards Cork City and Midleton, making commuting and exploring the surrounding area straightforward.\r\n\r\nThe wider area offers an excellent choice of amenities, with nearby Cobh providing a picturesque harbour setting, waterfront walks, cafés, restaurants, and a wealth of maritime and historical interest. Midleton is also readily accessible and offers an extensive range of shopping, restaurants, cafés, schools, and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nCork City is within convenient commuting distance, while Cork Airport and the region's major road network are also accessible, making Fota an attractive base for both permanent living and a weekend escape.\r\n\r\nFor leisure enthusiasts, the surrounding area provides an abundance of opportunities for walking, golf, sailing, boating, and exploring the beautiful coastline and countryside of East Cork.\r\n\r\nThe combination of Fota Island's historic estate setting, five-star resort facilities, excellent transport connections, and proximity to Cork's coastline and city amenities makes this a particularly desirable location."
